      "title": "Wardle Library to Close on 17th August Due to Staffing Issues",
      "slug": "wardle-library-to-close-on-17th-august-due-to-staffing-issues",
      "excerpt": "Wardle Library will be closed on Monday 17th August because of a lack of staffing resources, with plans to reopen on Tuesday 18th August at 9am.",
      "content_html": "<p>Wardle Library will be closed on Monday 17th August due to a shortage of staffing resources. The library aims to reopen on Tuesday 18th August at 9am.</p><p>The closure has been announced to inform local residents and library users of the temporary disruption to services. The library management has apologised for any inconvenience this may cause.</p><p>For those in need of library services during this time, the nearest alternative libraries are located in Smallbridge and Rochdale.</p><p>Residents are encouraged to check the library's website or contact them for updates regarding the reopening and any further changes to service availability.</p>",
